/* Terms (Terms.tsx) */
"terms.title" = "Terms of use";
"terms.brand_fallback" = "the business that sent you here";
"terms.1.title" = "1. Who you are dealing with";
"terms.1.p1" = "Identified (identified.cc) is a service of Fentord Technologies Limited, a company registered in Ghana. It provides identity verification and background screening, and these terms cover your use of this verification flow.";
"terms.1.p2" = "%@ asked you to verify. They decide what is checked, what the result is used for, and how long records are kept. Identified carries out the checks on their instructions and returns the result to them.";
"terms.1.p3" = "This means there are two relationships: yours with Identified for the flow itself, and yours with the business that sent you, which is governed by their own terms. Nothing here replaces theirs.";
"terms.2.title" = "2. Using this flow";
"terms.2.p1" = "You must be old enough to give consent under the law of the country you are in, and you must be verifying yourself. Do not use this flow on behalf of another person.";
"terms.2.p2" = "Submit documents that are genuine, current, and yours. Submit images of yourself, taken live, at the point you are asked for them.";
"terms.2.p3" = "Do not attempt to defeat the checks — no photographs of photographs, masks, screen replays, edited images, or documents belonging to someone else. Doing so may be a criminal offence, and the attempt is recorded and reported to the business that sent you.";
"terms.3.title" = "3. What we check, and what we do not decide";
"terms.3.p1" = "Depending on what the business selected, we may check that your document is genuine and unexpired, that your face matches its photo, that you are physically present, and that you do not appear on published sanctions and watchlists. We may verify a licence with the authority that issued it, and carry out criminal-record screening.";
"terms.3.p2" = "A check produces evidence, not a verdict about you. Sanctions screening in particular matches names and dates of birth, and people share both — a possible match is reviewed by a person before it is reported as anything.";
"terms.3.p3" = "Identified does not decide whether you get the job, the account, or the ride. That decision belongs to the business that sent you, and any appeal against it goes to them.";
"terms.4.title" = "4. Automated processing and human review";
"terms.4.p1" = "Most checks run automatically. A case is routed to a trained reviewer when the automated checks disagree, when an image cannot be read, or when screening returns something that needs judgement.";
"terms.4.p2" = "Where a background screening finding is adverse, a person always decides what happens next. Nothing is reversed automatically on an unreviewed match.";
"terms.4.p3" = "You can ask the business that sent you to have a person review any result reached about you.";
"terms.5.title" = "5. Your data";
"terms.5.p1" = "What we collect, why, and how long it is kept is set out on the Consent & privacy screen. Your agreement there is recorded with a version and a timestamp as evidence that it was given.";
"terms.5.p2" = "Identified deletes ID images and selfies a year after a check finishes and the rest of the record after five years, or sooner when the business that sent you asks. Unfinished verifications are deleted after 30 days.";
"terms.5.p3" = "Your biometric data is used to confirm you are live and that your face matches your document. It is not used to identify you anywhere else, and it is not sold, shared for advertising, or used to train anything.";
"terms.5.p4" = "You can withdraw consent, or ask for your data to be deleted, by contacting the business that sent you (or, for deletion, through the Identified verification portal, which passes the request to them). Withdrawing stops further processing; it does not undo a check that has already run or a result already delivered.";
"terms.6.title" = "6. Availability";
"terms.6.p1" = "This flow is provided as-is. Verification links expire, cameras fail, and third-party authorities go offline; we do not promise the service will be uninterrupted or that a check will always complete.";
"terms.6.p2" = "Nothing in these terms limits liability for fraud, for death or personal injury caused by negligence, or for anything else that cannot be limited under the law that applies to you.";
"terms.7.title" = "7. Law, changes and contact";
"terms.7.p1" = "Fentord Technologies Limited is registered in Ghana, and these terms are governed by Ghanaian law. That choice does not take anything away from you: any consumer or data-protection right you hold under the law of your own country applies regardless of what these terms say, and cannot be signed away here.";
"terms.7.p2" = "In particular, you keep the right to complain to the data-protection authority where you are — a Data Protection Commission or its equivalent — whatever these terms say.";
"terms.7.p3" = "Terms in force for this session: version %@. If they change, the version recorded against your session stays the one you agreed to.";
"terms.7.p4" = "Questions about the flow itself: hello@identified.cc (Fentord Technologies Limited, Ghana). Questions about why you were asked to verify, what the result was used for, or how long it is kept: the business that sent you.";
